 "how": [
  {
   "text": "按运行时版本分支：deviceInfo.sdkApiVersion >= 20 时 await access.enableBluetoothAsync() / access.disableBluetoothAsync()，catch 到 BusinessError 2900013、2900014 时开关按回读状态复位；低版本走 access.enableBluetooth() / disableBluetooth() 或设置页兜底",
   "support": [
    "case-fa0174cd489361d7586d#diagnosis",
    "case-fa0174cd489361d7586d#recommendation:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "开关显示以 access.getState() 和 access.on('stateChange', …) 回读为准，映射 BluetoothState 时把 STATE_BLE_ON 等 BLE 状态也覆盖到",
   "support": [
    "case-fa0174cd489361d7586d#diagnosis",
    "case-fa0174cd489361d7586d#recommendation:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "规格写成跳转设置而源码是应用内开关、SDK 又有可用接口时，回报规格疑点，不照旧保留跳转",
   "support": [
    "case-fa0174cd489361d7586d#recommendation:4"
   ]
  }
 ],
